				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">Multi-angle Imaging SpectroRadiometer</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://misr.jpl.nasa.gov/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The Multi-angle Imaging SpectroRadiometer (MISR) measurements are designed to improve understanding of the Earth’s environment and climate. MISR provides radiometrically and geometrically calibrated images in four spectral bands at each of nine widely-spaced angles. Spatial sampling of 275 and 1100 meters is provided on a global basis. All MISR data products are available in HDF-EOS format, and select products are available in netCDF format.</r3d:description>
